  "goodToKnow": "Die Grundsicherung is basic income support that secures the Existenzminimum: Grundsicherung im Alter und bei Erwerbsminderung for pensioners and people unable to work. For jobseekers, Hartz IV was replaced in 2023 by das Bürgergeld, and in 2025 the governing coalition agreed to turn this into a new Grundsicherung with stricter rules. Sozialhilfe is the general term for welfare. It has no plural."
